### AWS ###
*.aws-sam
claude.lock
# Per-machine Claude settings, except the shared workflow definitions —
# those are team artifacts. Git cannot re-include a file inside an ignored
# DIRECTORY, so the ignore has to be `.claude/*`, not `.claude/`.
.claude/*
!.claude/workflows/
